(2561, 486, 'mod_info', '<p><em><strong>MOD 1</strong></em></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><em>Unlimited Money </em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><em><strong>Note</strong>: When you log into the game, press the “Resume” button from the first menu you see, your coins are unlimited.</em></p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><em><strong>MOD 2</strong></em></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><em>– Mod Menu</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Add health</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Add health and money</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Addstamina</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Get a hearse</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Get a fuel truck</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Get a tank – get Apache helicopter</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Get jetpack</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Get stock car 1</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Get stock car 2</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Get stock car 3</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Get stock car 4</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Get weapon 1</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Get weapon 2</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Get weapon 3</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Get weapons 4</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Get a Revolution</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Lower the search level</em></li>\r\n<li><em>– Ninja mode</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>NOTE</strong>: <em>4 GB of free space is required on your device to install the game!</em> <em>Attention! This game is for devices with ARM64 CPUs (AArch64, arm64-v8a). You cannot install the modification on devices with 32-bit processors.</em></p>'),
