(4052, 730, 'mod_info', '<h4 data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>MOD 1</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><em><strong>[PLAYER FEATURES]</strong></em></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><em>God Mode</em></li>\r\n<li data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><em>Freeze Player (Only Bots)</em></li>\r\n<li data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><em>No Fall Damage</em></li>\r\n<li data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><em>Rapid Block Break</em></li>\r\n<li data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><em>Push Mobs Away</em></li>\r\n<li data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><em>Push Mobs Up</em></li>\r\n<li data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><em>Speed Run</em></li>\r\n<li data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><em>Speed UP</em></li>\r\n<li data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><em>Long Jump</em></li>\r\n<li data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><em>Long Jump v2</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><em><strong>–[GAME FEATURES]–</strong></em></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><em>Fly</em></li>\r\n<li><em>Gravity</em></li>\r\n<li><em>Zoom V1 2x</em></li>\r\n<li><em>Zoom V2 3x</em></li>\r\n<li><em>Big Chracter</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><em><strong>–[WATER FEATURES]–</strong></em></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><em>Jump High</em></li>\r\n<li><em>Long Jump</em></li>\r\n<li><em>Speed Run</em></li>\r\n<li><em>Trampoline</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><em><strong>–[OTHER FEATURES]–</strong></em></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><em>Weapon High Damage</em></li>\r\n<li><em>Auto Attack</em></li>\r\n<li><em>All Unlock</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>MOD 2</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><em><span class=\"red\"><strong>You cannot download and use paid content from the marketplace</strong></span>(skin sets, worlds, textures, etc.);</em></li>\r\n<li><em>Removed license check;</em></li>\r\n<li><em>A working character editor with all features unlocked (<span class=\"red\"><strong>skins are not saved after exiting the game</strong></span>);</em></li>\r\n<li><em>After starting the game, click on the round button in the upper left to open the menu mod with the ability to enable <strong>immortality</strong> (<span class=\"red\"><strong>only works in single player game</strong></span>).</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><em>If you have <strong>beta</strong> installed and you see an endless message with <strong>loading resources</strong>, then click on the Back button to close it.</em></p>'),
