(2, 1, '2025-07-03 06:17:11', '2025-07-03 06:17:11', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> May 06, 2025</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Overview</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>9mod.cc is an online service provider as defined by the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA). We enable legal copyright owners to self-publish on the internet by uploading, storing, and displaying various media through our services. We do not actively monitor, review, or analyze files uploaded to our servers by users. We take copyright infringement seriously and are committed to protecting the rights of legal copyright owners.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you are a copyright owner and believe that content on 9mod.cc infringes your copyright, you must notify us in writing to allow us to identify the allegedly infringing content and take appropriate action. Please follow the procedures outlined below.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">I. Designated Agent</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To report alleged copyright infringement under the DMCA, contact our designated agent via <a href=\"https://9mod.cc/contact/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://9mod.cc/contact/\">https://9mod.cc/contact/</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Upon receiving a proper notification of claimed infringement, 9mod.cc will follow the procedures outlined in this policy and the DMCA.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">II. Complaint Notice Procedures for Copyright Owners</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your copyright infringement claim must include the following elements:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>An electronic or physical signature of the copyright owner or a person authorized to act on behalf of the owner of an exclusive right that is allegedly infringed.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Identification of the copyrighted work claimed to have been infringed.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Identification of the material claimed to be infringing or the subject of infringing activity, including information sufficient to allow 9mod.cc to locate the material (e.g., a URL or specific description).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Contact information for the complaining party, such as an address, telephone number, and, if available, an email address.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A statement that the complaining party has a good faith belief that the use of the material is not authorized by the copyright owner, its agent, or the law.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A statement that the information in the notice is accurate and, under penalty of perjury, that the complaining party is authorized to act on behalf of the owner of an exclusive right that is allegedly infringed.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Failure to include all required information may delay the processing of your DMCA notification.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">III. Notice and Takedown Procedure</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>9mod.cc expects all users to comply with applicable copyright laws. Upon receiving a valid notification of claimed copyright infringement, we will promptly investigate and, if deemed valid in our sole discretion, remove or disable access to the material identified as infringing. We will also comply with DMCA provisions if a counter-notification is received.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">IV. Repeat Infringers</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>9mod.cc reserves the right to terminate the accounts or access of users who are determined to be repeat infringers, at our discretion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">V. Accommodation of Standard Technical Measures</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>9mod.cc accommodates and does not interfere with standard technical measures used by copyright owners to identify or protect their copyrighted works, provided such measures are deemed reasonable under the circumstances.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Contact Us</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For questions or to submit a DMCA notice, please contact us via our contact page at <a href=\"https://9mod.cc/contact/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://9mod.cc/contact/\">https://9mod.cc/contact/</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Digital Millennium Copyright Act (\"DMCA\") Policy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'open', '', 'dmca', '', '', '2025-07-10 16:36:41', '2025-07-10 11:36:41', '', 0, 'https://9mod.cc/?page_id=2', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(3, 1, '2025-07-03 06:17:11', '2025-07-03 06:17:11', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> May 06, 2025</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About Us</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to 5plays.org. Our website is located at <a href=\"https://5plays.org/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://5plays.org/\">https://5plays.org</a>. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you visit or interact with our website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Comments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you leave a comment on our website, we collect the information provided in the comment form, including your name, email address, and the comment content. Additionally, we capture your IP address and browser user agent string to assist with spam detection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may use an anonymized string (hash) derived from your email address to check if you use the Gravatar service. Gravatarâ€™s Privacy Policy can be found at <a href=\"https://automattic.com/privacy/\">https://automattic.com/privacy/</a>. If your comment is approved, your Gravatar profile picture may be publicly visible alongside your comment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Media</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you upload images to our website, please ensure they do not contain embedded location data (EXIF GPS). Visitors can download images from the website and may extract any embedded location data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We use cookies to enhance your experience on our website:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Comment Cookies:</strong> If you leave a comment, you can opt-in to save your name, email address, and website in cookies for convenience. These cookies expire after one year.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Login Cookies:</strong> Visiting our login page sets a temporary cookie to check if your browser accepts cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is deleted when you close your browser. Upon logging in, we set cookies to store your login information and display preferences. Login cookies last two days, and display preference cookies last one year. Selecting â€œRemember Meâ€ extends your login session to two weeks. Logging out removes these cookies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Editing Cookies:</strong> If you edit or publish an article, a cookie is saved in your browser to indicate the post ID of the edited article. This cookie contains no personal data and expires after one day.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Embedded Content from Other Websites</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our website may include embedded content (e.g., videos, images, articles) from other websites. This content behaves as if you visited the other website directly. These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed third-party tracking, and monitor your interactions, especially if you have an account and are logged in to those websites.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who We Share Your Data With</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email. We do not share your personal data with third parties except as necessary to provide our services or as required by law.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How Long We Retain Your Data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Comments and their metadata are retained indefinitely to recognize and approve follow-up comments automatically. For registered users, we store the personal information provided in their user profile. Users can view, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except for their username). Website administrators can also view and edit this information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What Rights You Have Over Your Data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have an account or have left comments, you can request an exported file of the personal data we hold about you. You may also request that we erase any personal data we hold, except for data we must retain for administrative, legal, or security purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where Your Data Is Sent</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service. For any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a href=\"https://5plays.org/contact/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://5plays.org/contact/\">https://5plays.org/contact/</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Privacy Policy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'open', '', 'privacy-policy', '', '', '2025-09-17 10:41:39', '2025-09-17 05:41:39', '', 0, 'https://9mod.cc/?page_id=3', 0, 'page', '', 0),
