(821, 1, '2025-08-28 10:23:43', '2025-08-28 05:23:43', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Experience Last Day on Earth: Survival – an entertaining and action-packed mobile game that puts you in the shoes of a survivor who wakes up to the world’s final apocalypse. A horrific virus has decimated the world, turning people into relentless mobs of bloodthirsty creatures. Only a handful of immune survivors are left, and you’re one of them, struggling to survive.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The objective of this game is to construct and improve a shelter in order to defend against zombie assaults. Beware of other survivors -- Some might be friendly and some could be determental to your survival. Roam an open world to scour for resources, craft weapons and tools, slay your enemies and strike back bellend!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sporting gorgeous graphics and easy-to-figure-out top-down controls, the game is addicting. A haunting soundtrack adds to the tension, and you can play alongside or against other players in multiplayer mode. If post-apocalyptic stories are your favorite, Last Day on Earth: Survival is an excellent survival game that will keep you entertained.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Last Day on Earth v1.39.6 MOD APK Mega Menu, Unlocked All for Android', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'last-day-on-earth-mod-apk', '', '', '2025-09-23 12:32:48', '2025-09-23 07:32:48', '', 0, 'https://9mod.cc/?p=821', 0, 'post', '', 0),
