(833, 1, '2025-08-28 13:58:11', '2025-08-28 08:58:11', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>YouTube Vanced Premium‌</strong> is a modded version of the official YouTube app that offers premium-like features without having to pay. It enables background playback, picture-in-picture mode and ad-free video streaming, providing a particularly valuable feature set for those who enjoy listening to music or podcasts via YouTube while they have other apps open. The interface is nearly indistinguishable from the YouTube app as it once was, so users are able to transition over without learning anything new.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>YouTube Vanced Premium also has the option to force high-resolution video playback, use dark and AMOLED themes, as well as play videos at desired speed or quality. It’s a people pleaser because it gives you the familiar YouTube service with some features that would otherwise require customers to subscribe to YouTube Premium. It’s not an official release, but has become popular with those Android users who find the tool a little lacking when it comes to flexibility and customization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'YouTube Vanced v20.29.34 MOD APK Premium, No ADS for Android', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'youtube-vanced', '', '', '2025-09-22 14:09:07', '2025-09-22 09:09:07', '', 0, 'https://9mod.cc/?p=833', 0, 'post', '', 0),
